Earth Fiends escape♪

00:01:18.048 --> 00:01:20.839
♪Golden Gate seals fast♪

00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:25.243
♪South Mountain Hunters
on the righteous path♪

00:01:26.752 --> 00:01:37.024
♪South Mountain Hunters
on the righteous path♪

00:01:37.024 --> 00:01:41.216
=Love on the Turquoise Land=

00:01:41.216 --> 00:01:44.000
(This story is a work of fiction)

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:47.012
=Episode 9=

00:02:01.424 --> 00:02:02.944
I'm helping you with a huge favor.

00:02:02.944 --> 00:02:04.385
And you brush me off with this?

00:02:17.024 --> 00:02:18.265
The Hunters' magic weapon?

00:02:18.584 --> 00:02:19.945
Only I have this.

00:02:20.265 --> 00:02:21.785
Ordinary weapons won't cause

00:02:21.864 --> 00:02:23.304
substantial damage on Earth Fiends.

00:02:23.464 --> 00:02:24.624
But this works wonders.

00:02:25.265 --> 00:02:28.105
Like using garlic against

00:02:28.505 --> 00:02:29.144
vampires?

00:02:31.505 --> 00:02:32.584
That's one way to put it,

00:02:32.945 --> 00:02:34.024
but the mechanism differs.

00:02:34.545 --> 00:02:36.304
Its design is for easy concealment.

00:02:36.545 --> 00:02:37.545
But remember.

00:02:37.704 --> 00:02:38.584
This isn't a weapon,

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:41.152
but something helps you escape
at critical moments.

00:02:41.471 --> 00:02:42.992
It can't launch an attack.

00:02:43.511 --> 00:02:45.751
And, Jiang Baichuan recognizes it.

00:02:52.232 --> 00:02:52.872
Well...

00:02:56.311 --> 00:02:57.152
Wait a second.

00:02:57.672 --> 00:02:59.471
You gave me such a crucial tool.

00:03:00.351 --> 00:03:01.631
May I ask

00:03:01.952 --> 00:03:03.791
what is Jiang Baichuan to you?

00:03:06.471 --> 00:03:08.112
He's the leader of the Hunters.

00:03:09.191 --> 00:03:10.511
He raised me.

00:03:14.872 --> 00:03:16.832
I see. Like a mentor and father to you.

00:03:18.872 --> 00:03:19.751
No time to waste.

00:03:19.992 --> 00:03:21.432
Go fulfill your promise now.

00:03:22.631 --> 00:03:24.672
Your plan to completely quit the Hunters

00:03:24.872 --> 00:03:25.872
has delayed, right?

00:03:31.832 --> 00:03:33.591
Free to join or quit
and act as you please.

00:03:33.591 --> 00:03:34.712
It's never easy.

00:03:35.392 --> 00:03:37.191
Even revered monks practicing lifelong

00:03:37.191 --> 00:03:38.272
may never achieve so.

00:03:40.872 --> 00:03:42.992
Enough philosophical talk.

00:03:43.471 --> 00:03:44.471
Let's get some breakfast.

00:03:44.832 --> 00:03:45.872
You stay. I'll get some.

00:03:57.296 --> 00:03:59.728
(Breakfast)

00:04:00.272 --> 00:04:01.432
Two, please.

00:04:02.272 --> 00:04:02.791
Thanks.

00:04:03.232 --> 00:04:03.732
Got it.

00:04:04.191 --> 00:04:04.832
Hey.

00:04:06.432 --> 00:04:07.232
What will you have?

00:04:07.311 --> 00:04:08.071
What's available?

00:04:08.351 --> 00:04:09.392
Everything. Look yourself.

00:04:11.031 --> 00:04:12.751
Alright, two of each then.

00:04:13.071 --> 00:04:13.571
Right away.

00:04:13.751 --> 00:04:14.672
Wait a moment.

00:05:18.391 --> 00:05:19.112
Breakfast.

00:05:24.112 --> 00:05:25.472
How long were you out there?

00:05:25.951 --> 00:05:27.511
Not long. It's still warm.

00:05:31.792 --> 00:05:33.872
Thanks, but I'm not hungry.

00:05:37.592 --> 00:05:38.552
Been up all night?

00:05:44.352 --> 00:05:46.191
Impressive. No food, no rest.

00:05:46.271 --> 00:05:48.151
So you Hunters fight
against Earth Fiends

00:05:48.151 --> 00:05:49.311
through sheer willpower?

00:05:50.232 --> 00:05:51.271
Even without food or rest,

00:05:51.951 --> 00:05:53.951
Jiang still got captured.

00:06:04.711 --> 00:06:06.831
Just tell me what you want me to do.

00:06:10.271 --> 00:06:13.311
Roadsound Group's influence in Xicang

00:06:13.311 --> 00:06:14.511
is tremendous.

00:06:14.872 --> 00:06:16.792
Even with all evidence in hand,

00:06:16.992 --> 00:06:19.472
Lin Xirou could still
use her connections

00:06:19.472 --> 00:06:21.232
and excuses to stall for time.

00:06:22.232 --> 00:06:24.271
Especially she has Jiang
as their hostage now.

00:06:25.032 --> 00:06:27.912
Reckless moves would alert her
and endanger Jiang.

00:06:30.071 --> 00:06:32.391
When I first met Lin Xirou as a child,

00:06:32.631 --> 00:06:34.151
she looked exactly like this.

00:06:34.511 --> 00:06:35.472
Many years have passed,

00:06:35.472 --> 00:06:36.711
she looks still the same.

00:06:36.951 --> 00:06:38.191
That's right.

00:06:39.151 --> 00:06:40.672
Earth Fiends have long lifespans.

00:06:40.872 --> 00:06:42.592
So time is what she lacks the least.

00:06:44.311 --> 00:06:45.552
She acts with meticulous care,

00:06:46.672 --> 00:06:48.751
caution and endless patience.

00:06:50.951 --> 00:06:51.951
Roadsound has weathered

00:06:51.951 --> 00:06:53.311
multiple business crises.

00:06:53.311 --> 00:06:54.751
No matter the opponent,

00:06:54.872 --> 00:06:57.151
she could stay composed
and counterattack.

00:06:59.391 --> 00:07:00.151
Of course.

00:07:00.912 --> 00:07:02.711
To fight us short-lived ones,

00:07:03.071 --> 00:07:04.472
time favors her.

00:07:05.191 --> 00:07:07.151
She waits for us to panic

00:07:07.271 --> 00:07:08.711
and blunder.

00:07:09.352 --> 00:07:11.872
Hence, we can't act recklessly.

00:07:18.592 --> 00:07:20.112
While caution matters,

00:07:21.472 --> 00:07:22.751
we can't stay passive.

00:07:23.831 --> 00:07:24.391
For example?

00:07:27.112 --> 00:07:27.872
Make her hurt.

00:08:30.071 --> 00:08:31.391
Put cartons in cold chain.

00:08:31.552 --> 00:08:32.712
The rest goes on next truck.

00:08:33.312 --> 00:08:34.511
Drive faster. No delays.

00:08:34.592 --> 00:08:35.312
Got it, Zheng.

00:08:41.551 --> 00:08:42.911
By the way, Zheng,

00:08:43.431 --> 00:08:45.511
can I take two days off
after this delivery?

00:08:45.992 --> 00:08:46.952
Why now?

00:08:48.271 --> 00:08:51.592
My mom's hospitalized, needs surgery.

00:08:51.952 --> 00:08:52.952
I'll go check on her.

00:08:56.151 --> 00:08:57.352
Then skip this delivery

00:08:57.751 --> 00:08:58.592
and go now.

00:08:59.232 --> 00:09:00.072
Family matters.

00:09:02.791 --> 00:09:03.751
No need, Zheng.

00:09:04.472 --> 00:09:05.352
Not that urgent.

00:09:05.751 --> 00:09:07.832
My mother still needs more observation.

00:09:08.072 --> 00:09:09.952
She might not need surgery.

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:14.160
(Purifies air, absorbs formaldehyde)

00:09:17.391 --> 00:09:18.151
Are you sure?

00:09:19.832 --> 00:09:20.631
Don't force it.

00:09:20.992 --> 00:09:21.712
Not at all.

00:09:22.072 --> 00:09:22.872
Not at all, Zheng.

00:09:23.112 --> 00:09:24.072
I'll go now, Zheng.

00:10:03.056 --> 00:10:04.144
(Message)

00:10:04.511 --> 00:10:05.192
Get off me!

00:10:12.688 --> 00:10:15.504
(Bangcheng Business Travel)

00:10:17.911 --> 00:10:19.551
You forgot something.

00:10:25.472 --> 00:10:26.431
Keep forgetting things.

00:10:46.072 --> 00:10:47.031
Miss me, okay?

00:10:47.832 --> 00:10:48.592
I'm leaving.

00:10:51.511 --> 00:10:52.271
Bye.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:56.784
(History of the World)

00:11:01.271 --> 00:11:02.751
Our trip to Xicang this time

00:11:03.192 --> 00:11:05.271
for camping or a picnic?

00:11:06.072 --> 00:11:08.312
Eat it or not. No question.

00:11:12.671 --> 00:11:14.551
If a woman treated me this well,

00:11:15.112 --> 00:11:16.151
I wouldn't leave her.

00:11:56.511 --> 00:11:57.352
Sis.

00:11:57.551 --> 00:11:59.352
Lin Ling is not a kid anymore.

00:11:59.751 --> 00:12:00.592
No need for you

00:12:00.592 --> 00:12:01.952
to escort her every time.

00:12:02.872 --> 00:12:04.192
Ms. Lin asked you

00:12:04.671 --> 00:12:06.791
where you went this morning.

00:12:07.992 --> 00:12:08.992
Ms. Lin asked me?

00:12:09.992 --> 00:12:12.592
Ms. Lin intended to escort her herself,

00:12:13.072 --> 00:12:15.751
but saw you rushing out
without going to the office,

00:12:15.911 --> 00:12:17.112
so sent me to check.

00:12:19.712 --> 00:12:21.511
Alright, I'll call her later.

00:12:21.511 --> 00:12:24.631
Ms. Lin said you can just tell me,

00:12:24.791 --> 00:12:26.112
and I'll relay it to her.

00:12:31.872 --> 00:12:34.031
I-I just went for breakfast.

00:12:34.472 --> 00:12:35.312
Breakfast?

00:12:36.911 --> 00:12:38.872
I scrolled through videos last night.

00:12:39.192 --> 00:12:40.271
Guess what I saw?

00:12:41.031 --> 00:12:43.751
The fried breadstick store
Ms. Lin often bought us to. Remember?

00:12:44.151 --> 00:12:45.511
The one behind our school?

00:12:46.072 --> 00:12:47.671
Exactly! Seeing it made me so hungry.

00:12:47.671 --> 00:12:48.992
I even stayed up all night

00:12:49.112 --> 00:12:50.192
from craving.

00:12:50.751 --> 00:12:51.872
So I went straight there

00:12:51.872 --> 00:12:52.992
this morning

00:12:53.192 --> 00:12:54.072
and bought a bunch.

00:12:54.232 --> 00:12:54.992
But,

00:12:56.192 --> 00:12:57.671
I barely ate a few bites.

00:12:58.072 --> 00:12:59.911
Look, they're still on the table.

00:13:02.031 --> 00:13:03.352
When it comes to food,

00:13:03.832 --> 00:13:05.671
Lin Ling's pastries are the best,

00:13:05.952 --> 00:13:07.031
tasty and healthy.

00:13:07.592 --> 00:13:08.952
Who knows if the breakfast store

00:13:08.952 --> 00:13:10.592
uses the recycled oil, right?

00:13:20.911 --> 00:13:21.992
Take care.

00:13:25.791 --> 00:13:28.031
When people grow up,

00:13:28.911 --> 00:13:31.391
they can't taste the flavors
in childhood anymore.

00:13:38.832 --> 00:13:40.431
Met your helper again?

00:13:45.751 --> 00:13:47.031
Any progress?

00:13:49.352 --> 00:13:50.352
Only bad news.

00:13:50.952 --> 00:13:52.431
Ms. Lin captured their man.

00:13:52.992 --> 00:13:54.431
To keep her helping us,

00:13:54.631 --> 00:13:55.671
I must help her this time.

00:14:00.551 --> 00:14:02.072
I have bad news too.

00:14:09.648 --> 00:14:15.088
(Car Rental Reimbursement Itinerary,
Roadsound Group, Xicang City)

00:14:16.352 --> 00:14:17.192
What's this?

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:18.952
(Benben Budget Hotel)

00:14:18.952 --> 00:14:20.832
From the files we saw earlier,

00:14:21.312 --> 00:14:23.712
those unregistered humanoid Earth Fiends

00:14:24.151 --> 00:14:25.472
are all coming to Xicang.

00:14:28.952 --> 00:14:30.312
They're planning something big.

00:14:32.031 --> 00:14:33.112
Send me the photos.

00:14:33.232 --> 00:14:34.751
Then delete them all.

00:14:34.791 --> 00:14:36.112
Including our chat history.

00:14:37.791 --> 00:14:39.312
Is it that serious?

00:14:39.911 --> 00:14:42.151
Didn't you see how solemn Sis was?

00:14:42.511 --> 00:14:44.031
You're under Ms. Lin's watch,

00:14:44.031 --> 00:14:45.031
in grave peril.

00:14:45.472 --> 00:14:47.151
So you must not be discovered.
Understand?

00:14:47.551 --> 00:14:49.551
These people are coming over here.

00:14:50.631 --> 00:14:53.192
Is it for the person you mentioned

00:14:53.472 --> 00:14:55.072
that Ms. Lin captured?

00:15:06.151 --> 00:15:08.031
(Available today? Usual spot.)

00:15:08.232 --> 00:15:09.791
(Okay.)

00:15:19.232 --> 00:15:20.031
Sent.

00:15:21.412 --> 00:15:25.671
(Car Rental Reimbursement Itinerary)

00:15:25.671 --> 00:15:26.472
What is this?

00:15:27.151 --> 00:15:28.472
A group of humanoid Earth Fiends

00:15:28.511 --> 00:15:29.992
are coming to Xicang.

00:15:30.271 --> 00:15:31.352
Others are flying in.

00:15:31.511 --> 00:15:33.551
Xiong Hei handles the pickup,
leaving us no chance.

00:15:34.431 --> 00:15:36.352
But two are driving from nearby

00:15:36.352 --> 00:15:37.391
separately by car.

00:15:37.872 --> 00:15:40.072
They'll stop at the hotel in Shihe.

00:15:40.992 --> 00:15:42.072
Sent you the details.

00:15:42.391 --> 00:15:43.312
Coming.

00:15:43.791 --> 00:15:44.592
The usual.

00:15:46.431 --> 00:15:46.952
Thank you.

00:15:46.952 --> 00:15:47.671
Thank you.

00:15:50.031 --> 00:15:51.192
What's your plan?

00:15:54.671 --> 00:15:56.791
Let's start by targeting these two.

00:16:10.832 --> 00:16:11.631
Eat up.

00:16:11.911 --> 00:16:12.911
At times like this,

00:16:12.911 --> 00:16:14.072
you have to have enough food.

00:16:15.472 --> 00:16:16.872
What you sent is useful.

00:16:17.192 --> 00:16:18.911
I need to figure out how to use it.

00:16:21.352 --> 00:16:24.072
Miss, you've brought
your boyfriend here so many times.

00:16:24.072 --> 00:16:26.511
Why don't you try our signature dessert?

00:16:26.992 --> 00:16:28.072
This one's on the house.

00:16:28.151 --> 00:16:29.551
Wishing you a sweet relationship!

00:17:03.791 --> 00:17:04.391
Hello.

00:17:06.911 --> 00:17:07.911
I have a plan.

00:17:08.872 --> 00:17:10.032
It might rescue Jiang.

00:17:11.072 --> 00:17:11.752
Go on.

00:17:12.471 --> 00:17:14.872
A group of humanoid Earth Fiends
are coming to Xicang.

00:17:15.191 --> 00:17:15.991
Capture them

00:17:16.151 --> 00:17:17.391
and trade with Lin Xirou.

00:17:17.832 --> 00:17:18.951
Where did you get this news?

00:17:19.631 --> 00:17:20.592
Don't you trust me?

00:17:21.032 --> 00:17:22.471
Even if we capture them,

00:17:23.231 --> 00:17:24.631
are you sure she'll make the trade?

00:17:25.191 --> 00:17:26.592
Once they reach Roadsound,

00:17:26.671 --> 00:17:27.792
we'll lose our chance.

00:17:30.431 --> 00:17:31.272
What's the plan?

00:17:32.151 --> 00:17:33.072
I'll tail them first.

00:17:33.592 --> 00:17:35.032
You stake out their destination.

00:17:35.431 --> 00:17:36.592
I'll send you the location.

00:17:36.991 --> 00:17:39.112
Don't take your own car to tail them.

00:17:39.671 --> 00:17:41.191
I know. I rented one.

00:18:31.792 --> 00:18:32.711
Tell everyone

00:18:33.991 --> 00:18:34.911
to get moving.

00:19:03.952 --> 00:19:05.808
(List, License Plates)

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:26.053
(Mount Anping Tunnel, 1320m long)

00:20:05.272 --> 00:20:07.951
Has this happened before?

00:20:11.112 --> 00:20:12.112
Wait, look.

00:20:13.352 --> 00:20:16.191
They're rushing us to Xicang this time.

00:20:18.431 --> 00:20:20.431
And there are so many of us.

00:20:23.671 --> 00:20:24.512
No idea.

00:20:28.911 --> 00:20:30.752
Pull over at the service area.

00:20:31.032 --> 00:20:31.792
I'll take a leak.

00:20:33.752 --> 00:20:34.951
We can't be late.

00:20:45.872 --> 00:20:46.951
No music.

00:20:47.872 --> 00:20:48.911
No chatting.

00:20:50.431 --> 00:20:51.312
Not even leaks?

00:21:12.951 --> 00:21:14.671
The Hound Clan of the Hunters

00:21:14.671 --> 00:21:16.112
can track us by scent.

00:21:17.911 --> 00:21:19.391
Thanks to Ms. Lin,

00:21:20.231 --> 00:21:21.951
we've taken human form

00:21:22.792 --> 00:21:23.671
without any scent.

00:21:35.352 --> 00:21:37.631
But if I can't hold it and wet my pants,

00:21:37.872 --> 00:21:39.391
the Hounds...

00:21:39.911 --> 00:21:42.032
m-must smell me from afar.

00:21:46.631 --> 00:21:47.391
Look at you.

00:21:47.832 --> 00:21:50.471
You never talk to me,

00:21:50.592 --> 00:21:51.752
instead, you take my joke

00:21:52.832 --> 00:21:54.072
pretty seriously.

00:22:52.711 --> 00:22:53.391
Let's go.

00:22:54.272 --> 00:22:56.512
Move now. You said we can't be late.

00:23:00.431 --> 00:23:03.072
That blue car's been tailing us.

00:23:15.151 --> 00:23:17.231
At the service area now.
Still some distance away.

00:23:17.832 --> 00:23:19.312
But they've spotted me.

00:23:20.951 --> 00:23:21.991
I'll reinforce you.

00:23:23.032 --> 00:23:25.072
No. Ambush them at the hotel.

00:23:26.431 --> 00:23:27.951
What if they attack you?

00:23:29.792 --> 00:23:30.792
Even better.

00:23:30.792 --> 00:23:31.872
If we fight at the hotel,

00:23:31.872 --> 00:23:32.951
it'll be more complicated.

00:23:33.231 --> 00:23:34.792
If they act rashly,

00:23:34.832 --> 00:23:36.431
I'll take them down here.

00:23:36.832 --> 00:23:38.631
Luo, don't be reckless.

00:23:40.231 --> 00:23:41.872
Alright, don't worry.

00:23:42.112 --> 00:23:43.272
I drive slowly.

00:23:43.352 --> 00:23:45.471
You'll have time to cook
after I exit the highway.

00:23:46.711 --> 00:23:47.512
See you tonight.

00:23:50.752 --> 00:23:51.512
Let's go.

00:23:52.832 --> 00:23:53.552
Is it necessary?

00:23:54.352 --> 00:23:55.191
Cut the crap.

00:23:59.272 --> 00:24:01.151
(Small Potato
Where are you now?)

00:24:10.858 --> 00:24:11.898
(Need me to come over?)

00:24:37.057 --> 00:24:38.297
She's really following us.

00:24:41.337 --> 00:24:42.257
Stay alert.

00:24:44.138 --> 00:24:45.577
Just a woman.

00:24:46.017 --> 00:24:47.297
Stop her and interrogate her.

00:24:48.297 --> 00:24:50.257
She might have backup.

00:24:51.898 --> 00:24:53.537
Let's go to a quiet spot first.

00:25:29.418 --> 00:25:30.698
- Let's go.
- Okay.

00:25:31.057 --> 00:25:32.337
Take your stuff.

00:26:24.890 --> 00:26:27.866
(Nie Jiuluo
Need me to come over?)

00:26:31.290 --> 00:26:33.306
(Yan Tuo)

00:26:53.218 --> 00:26:55.297
Sorry, the subscriber you dialed...

00:27:44.057 --> 00:27:44.817
Where are they?

00:27:48.698 --> 00:27:49.458
What time is it?

00:27:51.378 --> 00:27:51.878
7 PM.

00:28:00.938 --> 00:28:02.178
Sorry,

00:28:02.178 --> 00:28:04.658
the subscriber you dialed
is unavailable.

00:28:04.777 --> 00:28:06.138
Please try again later.

00:28:06.138 --> 00:28:06.938
Sorry,

00:28:06.938 --> 00:28:09.537
the subscriber you dialed
is unavailable.

